{"id":"punto","lemma":"punto","pos":"noun","rank":282,"glosses":["point (specific spot, location, or place)","point (unit of scoring)","point (full stop or period)"],"ipa":"/ˈpunto/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"puntos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/99/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-punto.wav","formAudio":{"puntos":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-GlyphEnjoyer-puntos.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Yo estaba a punto de comenzar.","en":"I was about to start.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453580","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to begin, to commence"}]},{"text":"¿Hay un punto de información?","en":"Is there an information counter?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704736","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"information, data"}]},{"text":"Nuestro equipo tiene dos puntos de ventaja.","en":"Our team is two points ahead.","words":[{"g":"our, ours, to us"},{"g":"team"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"dung, excrement"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"advantage"}]},{"text":"¿Hasta qué punto podemos confiar en él?","en":"To what degree can we trust him?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684326","words":[{"g":"until"},{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"to prune","l":"podar"},{"g":"to reassure"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"he"}]},{"text":"Mis puntos de vista han cambiado desde entonces.","en":"My views have changed since then.","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"sight"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"changed"},{"g":"since"},{"g":"then"}]}]}